Use SigCjC_ToolTip.pkg

// Task Panel Item Type
Define OLEXTPTaskPanelItemType for Integer
    // Link Item
    Define OLExtpTaskItemTypeLink for 1
    // Text Item
    Define OLExtpTaskItemTypeText for 2
    // Control Item
    Define OLExtpTaskItemTypeControl for 3

// Task Panel Visual Themes
Define OLEXTPTaskPanelVisualTheme for Integer
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeOffice2000 for 0
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeOffice2003 for 1
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeNativeWinXP for 2
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeOffice2000Plain for 3
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeOfficeXPPlain for 4
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeOffice2003Plain for 5
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeNativeWinXPPlain for 6
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeToolbox for 7
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeToolboxWhidbey for 8
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeListView for 9
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeListViewOfficeXP for 10
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeListViewOffice2003 for 11
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeShortcutBarOffice2003 for 12
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeResource for 13
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeVisualStudio2010 for 14
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeVisualStudio2012Light for 15
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeVisualStudio2012Dark for 16
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeOffice2013 for 17
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeOffice2016 for 17
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeVisualStudio2015 for 18
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeVisualStudio2017 for 19
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeVisualStudio2019 for 20
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeVisualStudio2022 for 21
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeCustom for 22
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeNativeWindows10 for 23
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelThemeNativeWindows11 for 24

// Task Panel Animation
Define OLEXTPTaskPanelAnimation for Integer
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelAnimationYes for 0
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelAnimationNo for 1
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelAnimationSystem for 2

// Task Panel Item layout
Define OLEXTPTaskPanelItemLayout for Integer
    Define OLExtpTaskItemLayoutDefault for 0
    Define OLExtpTaskItemLayoutImages for 1
    Define OLExtpTaskItemLayoutImagesWithText for 2
    Define OLExtpTaskItemLayoutImagesWithTextBelow for 3

// Task Panel Item Highlight
Define OLEXTPTaskPanelHotTrackStyle for Integer
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelHighlightDefault for 0
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelHighlightText for 1
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelHighlightImage for 2
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelHighlightItem for 3
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelHighlightNone for 4

// Task Panel Behaviour
Define OLEXTPTaskPanelBehaviour for Integer
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelBehaviourExplorer for 0
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelBehaviourList for 1
    Define OLExtpTaskPanelBehaviourToolbox for 2

// Item drag options
Define OLEXTPTaskPanelItemAllowDrag for Integer
    Define OLExtpTaskItemAllowDragNone for 0
    Define OLExtpTaskItemAllowDragDefault for 1
    Define OLExtpTaskItemAllowDragCopyWithinGroup for 2
    Define OLExtpTaskItemAllowDragCopyWithinControl for 4
    Define OLExtpTaskItemAllowDragCopyOutsideControl for 8
    Define OLExtpTaskItemAllowDragCopy for 12
    Define OLExtpTaskItemAllowDragMoveWithinGroup for 32
    Define OLExtpTaskItemAllowDragMoveWithinControl for 64
    Define OLExtpTaskItemAllowDragMoveOutsideControl for 128
    Define OLExtpTaskItemAllowDragMove for 192
    Define OLExtpTaskItemAllowDragWithinGroup for 34
    Define OLExtpTaskItemAllowDragWithinControl for 68
    Define OLExtpTaskItemAllowDrag for 204

Define OLEXTPTaskPanelBorderStyle for Integer
    Define OLExtpBorderNone for 0
    Define OLExtpBorderFlat for 1
    Define OLExtpBorderStaticEdge for 2
    Define OLExtpBorderClientEdge for 3
    Define OLExtpBorderFrame for 4

